   "source": "#{bold}##GOLD#Non Immediate#WHITE##{normal}#: This events adds new content that you have to find by exploration. If you die before finding it, there can be no refunds.",
   "target": "#{bold}##GOLD#非即时#WHITE##{normal}#：该事件为你后续游戏进程增加了部分内容。即使你在接触到新增内容前就死去也无法退款。",
