   "source": "#{bold}##GOLD#Once per Character#WHITE##{normal}#: This event can only be received #{bold}#once per character#{normal}#. Usualy because it adds a new zone or effect to the game that would not make sense to duplicate.",
   "target": "#{bold}##GOLD#每角色限一次#WHITE##{normal}#：这个事件 #{bold}#每名角色只能接收一次#{normal}#。通常是因为它添加了新地城或者其他游戏内不能重复添加的效果。",
